# Slayply Cursor Rules

All autonomous agent behavior and coding workflows must conform to `AGENTS.md`.

## Golden Rules
- Single Source of Truth: `docs/SPEC.md` > `docs/ROADMAP.md` > `docs/POINTER.md` > `docs/HANDBOOK.md`.
- Read `docs/POINTER.md` at session start.
- Run `pnpm run check` before submitting changes.
- Never commit directly to `main`.
- Never modify files in `temp/`.
